<title>PHILIPPINES: Solidbank sets Nov 26 record date for div.</title>
<headline>Solidbank sets Nov 26 record date for div.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Solidbank Corp said on Thursday it set November 26 as the record date for its three-peso cash dividend following approval of the dividend by the Central Bank.</p>
<p>The cash dividend will be payable on December 10. It will total 61.338 million pesos.</p>
<p>Solidbank paid a five-peso cash dividend in the second quarter of the year and in 1995 its cash dividends totalled 10 pesos per share.</p>
<p>--Manila newsroom (632) 841-8937</p>
</text>
